### VS Code REST Client (extension humao.rest-client). Start the server first: npm run dev
### Run `npm run seed`, then GET /diagrams and copy an "id" and a comment "id" into the variables below.
@base = http://localhost:3000
@id = 000000000000000000000001
@commentId = 000000000000000000000002

### List all diagrams -> 200
GET {{base}}/diagrams

### Filter by tag (array contains) and owner -> 200
GET {{base}}/diagrams?tag=shop&owner=anna

### One diagram -> 200
GET {{base}}/diagrams/{{id}}

### Well-formed but unknown ObjectId -> 404
GET {{base}}/diagrams/64b7f0c2a1b2c3d4e5f60718

### Not an ObjectId -> 400
GET {{base}}/diagrams/abc

### Create with tags -> 201 + Location
POST {{base}}/diagrams
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Login flow",
  "notation": "UML",
  "sourceCode": "user -> server",
  "priority": "normal",
  "owner": "carol",
  "tags": ["auth", "web"]
}

### Invalid data -> 400 with details
POST {{base}}/diagrams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "", "notation": "XYZ", "tags": [""] }

### Malformed JSON -> 400
POST {{base}}/diagrams
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title":

### Replace (comments are kept) -> 200
PUT {{base}}/diagrams/{{id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Order processing v2",
  "notation": "BPMN",
  "sourceCode": "start -> check -> pay -> ship",
  "priority": "low",
  "owner": "anna",
  "tags": ["shop"]
}

### Add a comment: $push into the nested array -> 201
POST {{base}}/diagrams/{{id}}/comments
Content-Type: application/json

{ "author": "boris", "text": "Add a refund branch" }

### Edit one comment inside the array: positional $ -> 200
PUT {{base}}/diagrams/{{id}}/comments/{{commentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "text": "Refund branch added" }

### Remove one comment: $pull -> 200
DELETE {{base}}/diagrams/{{id}}/comments/{{commentId}}

### Delete the diagram with its comments -> 204 (repeat it -> 404)
DELETE {{base}}/diagrams/{{id}}

### Unknown route -> 404
GET {{base}}/projects
